<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.67		   $ 0.64</p>
<p> Net			  3,844		    3,669</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>			    YEAR</p>
