<p> Net			 13,819		   13,621</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year results include one-time charge for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization which reduced net income by $1,059,000 or $0.19/shr. Excluding the charge, 1996 net income was $14.9 million or $2.60/shr.</p>
